{"id":"de963588ca881cd9","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-sum-type.md","title":"df-sum-type","display":"df-sum-type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-sum-type","aliases":["16-df-sum-type","Binary sum type"],"display":"df-sum-type","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-signature]]"],"source":"§10.1 pp.591–592 (PDF611–612), strong coproduct extension; §2.3 conversions","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-sum-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-sum-type</span><span>Binary sum type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sum-type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.1 pp.591–592 (PDF611–612), strong coproduct extension; §2.3 conversions"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>基础演算采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a> 的原始语法、结构规则、合同与判断等式。此页定义其可选强二元余积扩展；该构造不属于该文件已选的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\Pi,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Eq}\">\\(1,\\Pi,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Eq}\\)</span> 核心。</li>\n<li>下节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,a\">\\(A,a\\)</span> 分别为扩展原始类型、原始项文法的元变量；基础构造子的型属注释采用上游约定。新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e)\">\\(\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e)\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 绑定于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 分别绑定于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,e\">\\(d,e\\)</span>；以下规则显示时可省略由局部模式唯一给出的指标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 为扩展原始类型，判断型属均由各模式的显示前提提供；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 新鲜。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal P_\\Sigma\\)</span> 指上游 Assertion 实际逐条列出的有限规则模式表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_+(r)\">\\(\\operatorname{Inst}_+(r)\\)</span> 是这些模式在本页扩展原始文法中的全部原始实例（只检查绑定、新鲜性及显式侧条件，不预先要求可推导）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_f,\\rho_l,\\rho_r,\\rho_e,\\rho_{\\beta l},\\rho_{\\beta r},\\rho_\\eta,\\rho_{c+},\\rho_{cl},\\rho_{cr},\\rho_{ce}\">\\(\\rho_f,\\rho_l,\\rho_r,\\rho_e,\\rho_{\\beta l},\\rho_{\\beta r},\\rho_\\eta,\\rho_{c+},\\rho_{cl},\\rho_{cr},\\rho_{ce}\\)</span> 分别为下节显示的十一个新增模式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\">\\(\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\\)</span> 是此文法下的原始语境/四类判断编码集，按上游的同一判断格式构造。扩展推导闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_\\Sigma^+\">\\(\\mathsf D_\\Sigma^+\\)</span> 在下节定义，各分式是该闭包的元层生成规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}^+\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}^+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{RawTm}^+\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{RawTm}^+\\)</span> 为下节两个文法的有限树编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RawCtx}^+\">\\(\\mathsf{RawCtx}^+\\)</span> 是相应有限声明序列集；语境判断格式与上游相同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,p,d,e,Q\">\\(a,b,p,d,e,Q\\)</span> 在各模式前提给出的型属中取值。原有构造子的 FV 与替换递归式按上游逐条取同一模式的新文法实例；新增构造子的 FV、替换及新鲜性条件在 Assertion 单独给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 是有限变量替换，所有原始树取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类，故可以把各绑定变量换成满足所示条件的新鲜代表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;,T\">\\(A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;,T\\)</span> 为扩展原始类型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&#39;,b&#39;,p&#39;,d&#39;,e&#39;\">\\(a&#39;,b&#39;,p&#39;,d&#39;,e&#39;\\)</span> 为扩展原始项；合同模式同时给出各注释的相等、各分支的判断语境和结论两端的共同型属。下文裸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 统一指本页的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_\\Sigma^+\">\\(\\vdash_\\Sigma^+\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA&amp;::=1\\mid c(\\vec a)\\mid\\Pi(x:A).A\\mid\\Sigma(x:A).A\\mid\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,a)\\mid A+A,\\\\\na&amp;::=x\\mid d(\\vec a)\\mid *\\mid\\lambda_{A,x.A}(x.a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.A}(a,a)\\mid\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.A}(a,a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.A}(a)\\mid\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.A}(a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mid\\operatorname{inl}_{A,A}(a)\\mid\\operatorname{inr}_{A,A}(a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{case}_{A,A,z.A}(a;x.a,y.a).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA&amp;::=1\\mid c(\\vec a)\\mid\\Pi(x:A).A\\mid\\Sigma(x:A).A\\mid\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,a)\\mid A+A,\\\\\na&amp;::=x\\mid d(\\vec a)\\mid *\\mid\\lambda_{A,x.A}(x.a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.A}(a,a)\\mid\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.A}(a,a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.A}(a)\\mid\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.A}(a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mid\\operatorname{inl}_{A,A}(a)\\mid\\operatorname{inr}_{A,A}(a)\n\\mid\\operatorname{case}_{A,A,z.A}(a;x.a,y.a).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma&amp;::=()\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\qquad(A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}^+),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(A+B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(K_{A,B}(a))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(a)\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{inl},\\operatorname{inr}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\setminus\\{z\\})\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(d)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(e)\\setminus\\{y\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma(v)),\\\\\n(A+B)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\sigma]+B[\\sigma],\\\\\nK_{A,B}(a)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq K_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]}(a[\\sigma])\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{inl},\\operatorname{inr}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{case}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma],z.C[\\sigma]}\n(p[\\sigma];x.d[\\sigma],y.e[\\sigma])\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\bigl(\\{x,y,z\\}\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma&amp;::=()\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\qquad(A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}^+),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(A+B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(K_{A,B}(a))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(a)\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{inl},\\operatorname{inr}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\setminus\\{z\\})\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(d)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(e)\\setminus\\{y\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma(v)),\\\\\n(A+B)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\sigma]+B[\\sigma],\\\\\nK_{A,B}(a)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq K_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]}(a[\\sigma])\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{inl},\\operatorname{inr}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{case}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma],z.C[\\sigma]}\n(p[\\sigma];x.d[\\sigma],y.e[\\sigma])\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\bigl(\\{x,y,z\\}\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}}{\\Gamma\\vdash A+B:\\mathsf{Ty}},\\qquad\n\\rho_l\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inl}(a):A+B},\\qquad\n\\rho_r\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash b:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inr}(b):A+B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}}{\\Gamma\\vdash A+B:\\mathsf{Ty}},\\qquad\n\\rho_l\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inl}(a):A+B},\\qquad\n\\rho_r\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash b:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inr}(b):A+B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash p:A+B\\quad\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:C[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e:C[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z]}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(p;x.d,y.e):C[p/z]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash p:A+B\\quad\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:C[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e:C[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z]}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(p;x.d,y.e):C[p/z]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\beta l}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:C[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e:C[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z]}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(\\operatorname{inl}(a);x.d,y.e)= d[a/x]:C[\\operatorname{inl}(a)/z]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{\\beta l}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:C[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e:C[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z]}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(\\operatorname{inl}(a);x.d,y.e)= d[a/x]:C[\\operatorname{inl}(a)/z]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\beta r}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:B\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:C[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e:C[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z]}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(\\operatorname{inr}(b);x.d,y.e)= e[b/y]:C[\\operatorname{inr}(b)/z]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{\\beta r}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:B\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:C[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e:C[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z]}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(\\operatorname{inr}(b);x.d,y.e)= e[b/y]:C[\\operatorname{inr}(b)/z]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash Q:C}\n{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(z;x.Q[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z],y.Q[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z])= Q:C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash Q:C}\n{\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{z.C}(z;x.Q[\\operatorname{inl}(x)/z],y.Q[\\operatorname{inr}(y)/z])= Q:C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{c+}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash A+B=A&#39;+B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{c+}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash A+B=A&#39;+B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{cl}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a=a&#39;:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inl}_{A,B}(a)=\\operatorname{inl}_{A&#39;,B&#39;}(a&#39;):A+B},\\qquad\n\\rho_{cr}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b=b&#39;:B}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inr}_{A,B}(b)=\\operatorname{inr}_{A&#39;,B&#39;}(b&#39;):A+B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{cl}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a=a&#39;:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inl}_{A,B}(a)=\\operatorname{inl}_{A&#39;,B&#39;}(a&#39;):A+B},\\qquad\n\\rho_{cr}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b=b&#39;:B}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{inr}_{A,B}(b)=\\operatorname{inr}_{A&#39;,B&#39;}(b&#39;):A+B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{ce}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\begin{gathered}\n\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C=C&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash p=p&#39;:A+B\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d=d&#39;:C[\\operatorname{inl}_{A,B}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e=e&#39;:C[\\operatorname{inr}_{A,B}(y)/z]\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e):T\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{A&#39;,B&#39;,z.C&#39;}(p&#39;;x.d&#39;,y.e&#39;):T\n\\end{gathered}}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e)\n=\\operatorname{case}_{A&#39;,B&#39;,z.C&#39;}(p&#39;;x.d&#39;,y.e&#39;):T}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{ce}\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\begin{gathered}\n\\Gamma\\vdash A=A&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash B=B&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash C=C&#39;:\\mathsf{Ty}\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash p=p&#39;:A+B\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d=d&#39;:C[\\operatorname{inl}_{A,B}(x)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash e=e&#39;:C[\\operatorname{inr}_{A,B}(y)/z]\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e):T\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{A&#39;,B&#39;,z.C&#39;}(p&#39;;x.d&#39;,y.e&#39;):T\n\\end{gathered}}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{case}_{A,B,z.C}(p;x.d,y.e)\n=\\operatorname{case}_{A&#39;,B&#39;,z.C&#39;}(p&#39;;x.d&#39;,y.e&#39;):T}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_\\Sigma^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathcal P_\\Sigma\\cup\n\\{\\rho_f,\\rho_l,\\rho_r,\\rho_e,\\rho_{\\beta l},\\rho_{\\beta r},\\rho_\\eta,\\rho_{c+},\\rho_{cl},\\rho_{cr},\\rho_{ce}\\}}\n\\operatorname{Inst}_+(r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_\\Sigma^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathcal P_\\Sigma\\cup\n\\{\\rho_f,\\rho_l,\\rho_r,\\rho_e,\\rho_{\\beta l},\\rho_{\\beta r},\\rho_\\eta,\\rho_{c+},\\rho_{cl},\\rho_{cr},\\rho_{ce}\\}}\n\\operatorname{Inst}_+(r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}^+\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty},\\ \\Gamma\\vdash A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\ \\Gamma\\vdash a:A,\\ \\Gamma\\vdash a=b:A\n\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}^+,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}^+,\\ a,b\\in\\mathsf{RawTm}^+\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf R_\\Sigma^+(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\\mid\n(\\exists\\vec p\\in X^{&lt;\\omega})\\ \\langle\\vec p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_\\Sigma^+\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf D_\\Sigma^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\\mid\\mathsf R_\\Sigma^+(X)\\subseteq X\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma\\vdash^+J&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow J\\in\\mathsf D_\\Sigma^+.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}^+\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty},\\ \\Gamma\\vdash A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\ \\Gamma\\vdash a:A,\\ \\Gamma\\vdash a=b:A\n\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}^+,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}^+,\\ a,b\\in\\mathsf{RawTm}^+\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf R_\\Sigma^+(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\\mid\n(\\exists\\vec p\\in X^{&lt;\\omega})\\ \\langle\\vec p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R_\\Sigma^+\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf D_\\Sigma^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{RawJdg}^+\\mid\\mathsf R_\\Sigma^+(X)\\subse